aria-move (1.5.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Recover from timestamp-only changes on completed SMB downloads by retrying
    verified copies before publication and reverifying published bytes before
    source cleanup. Keep size, identity and content checks strict.
  * Include old/new source metadata in change diagnostics.
  * Add concurrent completion-hook, real-share and Debian 13 virtual-disk tests.

