aria-move (1.5.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rework logging: application errors always go to the system log; the log
    file level selects warnings/errors, completed moves or everything.
  * Generate the RPC secret at install time and make it the only token source.
  * Add RPM packaging for RHEL/Alma/Rocky 9+ and Fedora.

